          "plaintext": "So many good memories! From top left, clockwise - there's @psingletary.com overseeing things, @bmann.ca  meeting @buildwithtori.com  & Tori mom, inside Hex House, @knowtheory.net  & @ngerakines.me  are all smiles, @henryzoo.com  and his atproto printer while @syntacrobat.xyz  looks on, the sidewalk crew in the heat."
        },
